
Uluhlu xa-kufika: ['product'] yenza: {
	>> total := 1.
	ngokwakho nganye: { :index :element
		total phinda-ngo: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Uluhlu ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
Imveliso bhala: a product, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (Uluhlu ← 2 ; 4 ; 8) product, umgca-omtsha. 
Imveliso bhala: (Uluhlu ← -2 ; 10) product, umgca-omtsha. 
Imveliso bhala: (Uluhlu ← 0.5 ; -2) product, umgca-omtsha. 
